い応募します。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/MHoO7NI\n\n上記のキャラクターをお願いします。\n\n腰に結んだリボンだけ赤で表現していただければ幸いです（茶色ではありません）。\n\nその他、表情や体型、姿勢は作家さんのお好きな描き方で丸くお願いします。\n\n同様に、全身が丸見えである必要はありません。\n作家さんは通常、腰のラインまでしか描かないので！（私はそのスタイルが好きです！）。\n\n翻訳が失礼にならないか心配です。\n\nありがとうございました", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 110962, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "仂ｲｶ", "screen_name": "ikasyuumai", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1001532901287079936/72gnSM19.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/111878483/1708307738/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 33}, {"id": 326698, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "yaigi 3/20~連載開始", "screen_name": "_yaigi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1946180735783612416/oA1GWm-U.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1575700099/1644740427/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "video"}], "nc": 176}, {"id": 1397781, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "ナガサキ", "screen_name": "osushi_kome", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1726889238384570368/T4nw0-yZ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1331503373980319747/1623168124/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "t